<title>SPAIN: Madrid stocks steam to new record at opening.</title>
<headline>Madrid stocks steam to new record at opening.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Madrid stocks opened higher on Wednesday, continuing a bull run with both indices hitting new opening highs, dealers said.</p>
<p>At the start the Ibex-35 blue chip index was 0.95 percent higher at 6,738.67. In the meantime also the broader Madrid general index set a new record, adding 0.87 percent to 582.78.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
